'''Zenezians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]]. The [[musician]] [[Infrablue Zedbeddy Coggins]] was a Zenezian,<ref name="Choose Your Destiny" /> as was [[Sudswater Dillifay Glon]].<ref name="Episode VII" /> It was considered a major insult to refuse a [[music]]al instrument from a Zenezian.<ref name="Choose Your Destiny" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Zenezians first appeared in the [[2015]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']],<ref name="Episode VII" /> but were not identified until the [[2019]] audiobook ''[[Choose Your Destiny: A Maz's Castle Mission]]'', written by [[Cavan Scott]]. The spelling of Zenezian was unconfirmed<ref name="Choose Your Destiny" /> until Scott provided it via [[Wikipedia:Twitter|Twitter]].<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|cavanscott|status/1255169272097263617|[[Cavan Scott]]|quote=In the script it's 'Zenezian'.|archivefile=File:ScottZenezian.png}}</ref>

